# ===== NVT PRODUCTION =====
timestep 1.0
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 20 delay 0 check yes
fix nvt all nvt temp 430.0 430.0 2000.0
fix recenter all recenter NULL NULL NULL units box every 100
fix shakes all shake 0.0001 20 0 b 0.4 1.0 a 1
thermo 5000
thermo_style custom step temp press density pe ke etotal
dump nvt_prod all custom 5000 nvt_production.lammpstrj id type x y z
run 100000000
